I know some of you didn't,

00:18:53.910 --> 00:18:55.060
like, I know there's a delta,

00:18:55.060 --> 00:18:56.750
some of you did a ton of ton of shit,

00:18:56.750 --> 00:19:00.070
you know, I can't control
900 people every second,

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:02.830
but why there's a culture
more here of like,

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:04.047
compared to some of your
friends who are like,

00:19:04.047 --> 00:19:05.037
"Really, you're doing shit?

00:19:05.037 --> 00:19:07.542
"Like, I'm fuckin', like
just sitting here, like,

00:19:07.542 --> 00:19:10.455
"fuckin' playing on fuckin',"
who the fuck, anyway,

00:19:10.455 --> 00:19:13.670
(laughter)
is because of that respect

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:17.170
for, maybe you're good enough
to run my company right now.

00:19:17.170 --> 00:19:18.423
Like, talent is talent.

00:19:19.740 --> 00:19:24.690
And so, but candor,
smelling roses, stand out.

