00:21:16.360 --> 00:21:18.270
I don't think you have a perspective.

00:21:18.270 --> 00:21:20.070
I don't think anybody does,
and I'm not even sure I do,

00:21:20.070 --> 00:21:21.750
I just try my best to think about this,

